    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Eriadu\" title=\"Eriadu\">Eriadu</a> (Planet) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor that provides an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p>Crafted on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>-dominated world of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Eriadu\" title=\"Eriadu\">Eriadu</a>, Eriadun Armor helps soldiers avoid being taken prisoner and interrogated by enemy forces. </p><p><b>Armor:</b> A suit of Eriadu Armor or an Eriadu <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Shield\">Energy Shield</a> provides <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 5 against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun_Damage\" title=\"Stun Damage\">Stun Damage</a>, but any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> provided by the armor is reduced by one (to a minimum of +0). </p>",
